        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo milimo yoonse Solomoni njaakacitila iŋanda ya-Jehova yakamana, nkabela Solomoni wakaleta zintu zisalala zya-Davida wisi, ansiliva angolida azibelesyo zyoonse, wazibika muziyobwedo zyaŋanda ya-Leza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
