        },
        {
          "text": "abalo basikwiimba ba-Levi boonse, Asafu a-Hemani a-Jedutuni abana babo abakwabo, bakalisamine masani aatuba, bakali azizyano atuntimbwa anamalwa, bakaliimvwi kubbazu lyakujwe lyacipaililo, bakali abapaizi bali mwanda amakumi obile basikulizya myeembo; ",
          "type": "text",
